:american_sign_language rdf:type :BackgroundKnowledge ;
                rdfs:label "American Sign Language (ASL)"@en ;
                rdfs:comment "The woman in the image is using American Sign Language, a visual language used by many deaf and hard-of-hearing individuals in the United States. Understanding that ASL is a legitimate and complex language is essential to interpreting the communication happening in the image and the joke's context."@en ;
                :extractionMethod "llm_extraction_huggingface" ;
