:mocking rdf:type :Emotion ;
                rdfs:label "mocking emotion"@en ;
                rdfs:comment "The emotion expressed is mocking, conveyed through the humorous and stereotypical text overlay that plays on the 'Rule of the Club' trope, implying that deaf people are secretive about their community. This is a form of ableist humor that mocks the deaf community by suggesting they are secretive or exclusive, which is a harmful stereotype."@en ;
                :extractionMethod "llm_extraction_huggingface" ;
                :extractedFrom "90826.png" ;
